  "item_short_desc": "<p>Dominate extreme weather conditions with Rothco&rsquo;s Hard Shell Waterproof Jacket, designed for ultimate protection in harsh environments. This tactical jacket features a 3-layer waterproof and breathable shell with a TPU membrane and laminated mesh, keeping you dry and comfortable during your outdoor activities. Waterproof seam taping throughout the jacket ensures complete protection from the elements. With 6 pockets located on the front, biceps, and concealed chest, you can securely store your essentials while keeping them dry.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "133028",
  "description": "<p>Dominate extreme weather conditions with Rothco&rsquo;s Hard Shell Waterproof Jacket, designed for ultimate protection in harsh environments. This tactical jacket features a 3-layer waterproof and breathable shell with a TPU membrane and laminated mesh, keeping you dry and comfortable during your outdoor activities. Waterproof seam taping throughout the jacket ensures complete protection from the elements. With 6 pockets located on the front, biceps, and concealed chest, you can securely store your essentials while keeping them dry. The 7-snap storm flap with an additional badge flap provides further protection and functionality. Adjustable wrist cuffs and a drawstring bottom offer a snug fit to keep out wind and rain. For added versatility, the stow-away hood with cinch cord and barrel lock adjusters provides full coverage when needed. With reinforced elbows for durability and underarm zipper vents for breathability, this hard shell jacket is built to last in any weather.</p>",
